        <section eId="part-1__sec-3">
          <num>3</num>
          <heading>Definitions</heading>
          <content>
            <p>In this Act:</p>
            <p><term refersTo="#term-approved-form">approved form</term> means <def>a form approved by the Minister.</def></p>
            <p><term refersTo="#term-foreign-vessel">foreign vessel</term> includes <def>a vessel registered outside Australia.</def></p>
            <p><term refersTo="#term-relevant-period">relevant period</term> has the meaning given by <def><ref href="#part-1__sec-7">section 7</ref>.</def></p>
          </content>
